+#### 关于 `start` vs 裸 objective
+
+| 输入 | 语义 |
+| --- | --- |
+| `/goal 修登录 bug` | set-objective 整串；`POST { objective }` only |
+| `/goal start 修登录 bug` | `POST { objective, status: "active" }` |
+| `/goal set 修登录 bug` | 同裸 set-objective |
